    <string name="fault_codes_info_message">Diagnostic Trouble Codes (DTCs)\n\nPERMANENT CODES (Red)\nEmissions-related codes that cannot be cleared with a scan tool. These clear automatically when the vehicle detects the issue is resolved.\n\nSTORED CODES (Orange)\nActive faults that triggered the Check Engine Light. These indicate current issues that need attention.\n\nPENDING CODES (Yellow)\nIntermittent issues detected but not yet confirmed. The ECU is monitoring these conditions.\n\nCODE PREFIXES:\nP - Powertrain (Engine, Transmission)\nC - Chassis (ABS, Suspension)\nB - Body (Airbags, Climate Control)\nU - Network or Communication\n\nHow It Works:\nThis page scans your vehicle using OBD-II Mode 03 (stored codes), Mode 07 (pending codes), and Mode 0A (permanent codes). Tap any code to inspect details, clear codes, or research fixes.</string>
